(text "PRE-REG ENTRY (bom 17(d)/(l), option B 2026-10-12: SHARED pre-reg rails + per-channel POL LDOs): four rails from the power tube enter on TWO edge connectors - J603 top edge feeds the L-channel POL cluster + clock LDOs, J604 bottom edge feeds the R-channel cluster + the shared digital LDOs. The tube Y-fans-out each rail so each channel's harness leg carries its own (channel-correlated) current; on-board the two entries are the same nets. P16A (+16.2 V -> +15 V-class POLs), N16A (-16.2 V -> N15A/VEE15), V8P3 (+8.3 V -> VE1), V4P3 (+4.3 V -> every 3.3 V-class POL: P5A/V33CLK/V33FF/V33D/V33RLY)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4e8177fc-a9e4-4f80-81d0-610afef7d437"))
