(text "J603 = top edge (L side), J604 = bottom edge (R side); 0.100-inch stacker headers (Samtec TW/ESQT class) for the ~30 mm board-to-board stack to the power-tube board - ~3 A/pin vs <= 0.5 A/rail. Each rail sits beside its own GND return; 10 uF local bulk per rail per connector - the heavy bulk/filtering lives in the tube. PWR_FLAGs are in the rails table on REFS_L." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 118.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "02e8dcc8-1c93-47ed-9315-18fe30a9169b"))
